tle></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="716.4" x2="716.4" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="716.4" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="716.4" y="164" text-anchor="middle">6</text><title>c. 619: The Sasanian Persians take Alexandria and occupy Egypt until 629</title></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="740.0" x2="740.0" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="740.0" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="740.0" y="164" text-anchor="middle">7</text><title>641: Alexandria is surrendered by treaty to the Rashidun Caliphate</title></g><text class="rf-axis" x="20" y="200">30 BCE</text><text class="rf-axis" x="740" y="200" text-anchor="end">641 CE</text></svg><figcaption>Relative power on the Institute's 0–10 scale (each profile scaled to its own peak). Numbers mark the key events below.</figcaption></figure><ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">30 BCE</span><span class="rf-text">Octavian takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alexandria">Alexandria</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mark-antony">Antony</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cleopatra-vii">Cleopatra VII</a> die</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">115–117</span><span class="rf-text">Jewish revolt destroys the Jewish community of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alexandria">Alexandria</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">212</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constitutio-antoniniana">Constitutio Antoniniana</a> makes most free <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/egyptians">Egyptians</a> Roman citizens</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 320s</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pachomius-the-great">Pachomius</a> founds communal monasteries at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tabennisi">Tabennisi</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">451</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/council-of-chalcedon">Council of Chalcedon</a>; most Egyptian Christians reject its creed</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 619</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Persians</a> take <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alexandria">Alexandria</a> and occupy <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/egypt">Egypt</a> until 629</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">641</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alexandria">Alexandria</a> is surrendered by treaty to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rashidun-caliphate">Rashidun Caliphate</a></span></li></ol>
